 "remarks": "A Rare Find at Fountain Terrace: Custom Renovation & Private Entrance! This is not your typical Fountain Terrace condo. Beautifully renovated with custom features, this first-floor 2-bedroom residence offers style, convenience, and character, including a private ground-level exterior entrance. Step inside to a modern interior with new flooring, fresh paint, new appliances, and updated kitchen and bath finishes. The kitchen features stone countertops, updated cabinetry, and a built-in peninsula offering extra prep space and storage. A custom wine bar with bottle storage and a wine fridge adds a special touch for entertaining. Custom fireplaces and detailed millwork enhance the living room and primary bedroom. Two spacious bedrooms offer flexibility for guests or a home office, while the refreshed bathroom completes the updates. The first-floor location and private exterior entrance allow convenient direct access, and a private patio extends the living space outdoors. Enjoy a gated community with an outdoor pool, fitness center, parking, and a Stamford location convenient to downtown, schools, shopping, restaurants, parks, and transportation. Newly renovated. Custom-finished. Private entrance. Move-in ready and waiting for you to make it your own!",
